{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49257","headline":"木兰花 · 温庭筠","name":"木兰花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家临长信往来道，乳燕双双拂烟草。\n油壁车轻金犊肥，流苏帐晓春鸡早。\n笼中娇鸟暖犹睡，帘外落花闲不扫。\n衰桃一树近前池，似惜容颜镜中老。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}